    "sub_name": "專題製作",
    "sub_ename": "MONOGRAPH",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要為使中文系大學部學生連結運用課程所學，藉由發現與解決問題 的歷程，讓學生能整合知識，在做中學與知識分享中，感受學習的樂趣；透過團隊合作方式進行學習，以培養學生創造思考及解決問題的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is mainly to connect Chinese college students with medical courses, through the process of discovering and solving problems, so that students can integrate knowledge, and feel the joy of learning while doing knowledge and sharing in middle school; learning through teamwork to train students Creative thinking and problem solving skills.",
